2026-11-06T03:01:14.1976376Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-11-06T03:01:14.1976965Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-11-06T03:01:14.1977265Z 
2026-11-06T03:01:14.1977517Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
