2026-11-06T03:01:14.2053761Z [34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
2026-11-06T03:01:14.2062824Z [0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
2026-11-06T03:01:14.2063483Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
2026-11-06T03:01:14.2063880Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
2026-11-06T03:01:14.2064046Z 
