2026-11-06T03:01:14.2064515Z 
2026-11-06T03:01:14.2064723Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
2026-11-06T03:01:14.2065056Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
2026-11-06T03:01:14.2065234Z 
2026-11-06T03:01:14.2065325Z If you would like to
2026-11-06T03:01:14.2065554Z see the output, try like this:
2026-11-06T03:01:14.2065705Z 
2026-11-06T03:01:14.2065909Z   $ curl -L -o install-nix https://nixos.org/nix/install
2026-11-06T03:01:14.2066212Z   $ sh ./install-nix
